et/manual/zh/class.mongodb-driver-exception-connectionexception.php" class="classname">MongoDB\Driver\Exception\ConnectionException</a></span> if connection to the server fails (for reasons other than authentication).</li><li>Throws <span class="classname"><a href="https://php.net/manual/zh/class.mongodb-driver-exception-authenticationexception.php" class="classname">MongoDB\Driver\Exception\AuthenticationException</a></span> if authentication is needed and fails.</li>   <li>Throws <span class="classname"><a href="https://php.net/manual/zh/class.mongodb-driver-exception-runtimeexception.php" class="classname">MongoDB\Driver\Exception\RuntimeException</a></span> on other errors.</li>  </ul> </div></div>
